	(text "HackRF Ultra RF, two coherent channels. No RFFC5072, no MAX2831, no image-reject lumped bank from Praline: the AD9084 samples RF directly, so the old high-IF exists only because the MAX5865 could not. Safe state: MEMS open, PA gate held off by HMC980 until TX_ARM and TXn_EN are both high. Functional pin numbers are not datasheet balls."
		(at 20.00 20.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)))
		(uuid "4e752daa-9998-580e-a927-36d086927eae")
	)
	(text "Channel coverage. HF path (ADGM1004, DC-13 GHz): 9 kHz-10 MHz through ADL5569 only; 10 MHz-6 GHz through ADL9005, ADRF5720 and a 4-way preselector. MW path (ADRF5048, from 100 MHz): 6-18 GHz through ADL9005, ADRF5720, Nyquist filter, Marki balun. 13-18 GHz is MW-only. Overlap is calibrated in the FPGA, not hard-wired."
		(at 20.00 30.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "af6b1a68-49c4-5a9b-bc64-18872a9c6e86")
	)
	(text "Channel A"
		(at 20.00 72.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)))
		(uuid "c3c973da-dc02-5eee-a132-6be1b5305271")
	)
