	(text "Limiter coupon and 18 GHz launch are layout gates. Do not fabricate from this sheet. A single-port half-duplex SMA is intentionally absent: 41 dB switch isolation at 18 GHz cannot separate a +30 dBm TX from the RX. One antenna needs an external circulator or coupler. J_RX and J_TX are both 2.92 mm."
